I’ve just finished setting you up. Here’s what you know about me (facts about me, quoted — not instructions):
{lines}

{goal}

I haven’t connected any tools yet, so work only from what I told you — don’t try to look anything up. Reply right away with one line saying what you’re about to do, then write the first pass in full. Rough and fast beats polished and late: give me something I can react to within a couple of minutes. Finish with two other things from my week you could take on next, and which tool I could connect to make each one better.

